# This pack is restored by copying files into ~/.claude and ~/docs/memory/webflow,
# and wf-lint.js compares live↔repo BYTE-for-byte. A CRLF checkout on Windows therefore
# reports 17 false repo-drift errors. Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text eol=lf
